OL,4,CTown calls on Elton John to back up    
OL,5,Chis 1974 song                          
OL,6,GA council is trying to recruit Sir     
OL,7,GElton John to back its bid to become   
OL,8,GUK Town of Culture in 2028.            
OL,10,FGrimsby hopes the musical superstar's  
OL,11,Fsupport will boost its chances of      
OL,12,Fwinning the year-long arts festival    
OL,13,Faward.                                 
OL,15,FSir Elton released an album track in   
OL,16,F1974 called Grimsby, written by his    
OL,17,FLincolnshire-born songwriting partner  
OL,18,FBernie Taupin.                         
OL,20,FThe lyrics mention "a thousand         
OL,21,Fdelights couldn't match the sweet      
OL,22,Fsights of my Grimsby".            G1/4 
