OL,4,CPenny the peahen finds fame in her new 
OL,5,Chome                                   
OL,6,GA Sheffield suburb's residents have    
OL,7,Gwelcomed an inquisitive peafowl into   
OL,8,Gtheir community after the bird set up  
OL,9,Ghome in local streets and gardens.     
OL,11,FThe peahen was first spotted near      
OL,12,FHillsborough Park in June, with the    
OL,13,F"serial trespasser" regularly flying   
OL,14,Fbetween the same few streets.          
OL,16,FDubbed Penny by the locals, a Facebook 
OL,17,Fpage reporting her antics through      
OL,18,Fphotos and videos has more than 850    
OL,19,Ffollowers.                             
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
