OL,4,CVictim of Krakow gun attack returns    
OL,5,Chome to York                           
OL,6,GA British man shot in the Krakow       
OL,7,Gattack earlier this month is on his    
OL,8,Gway home after receiving treatment in  
OL,9,Ghospital, his family have said.        
OL,11,FHarry Marchant, from York, suffered a  
OL,12,Fgunshot wound in the Polish city's     
OL,13,Fbusy Main Market Square on 7 November. 
OL,15,FThe York City supporter, whose 20th    
OL,16,Fbirthday was on Wednesday, was one of  
OL,17,F15 people injured in the attack, which 
OL,18,Fkilled one British man.                
OL,20,FMarchant's family said that he had     
OL,21,Fbeen discharged from hospital and was  
OL,22,Freturning home "via ambulance".   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
