OL,4,CFood banks facing 'critically low'     
OL,5,Cdonation levels                        
OL,6,GFood banks in Yorkshire and northern   
OL,7,GLincolnshire are facing critically low 
OL,8,Gdonation levels, according to anti-    
OL,9,Gpoverty charity Trussell.              
OL,11,FSurvey data from the charity found     
OL,12,Ffour in 10 of the area's food banks    
OL,13,Fwere struggling for donations as they  
OL,14,Fprepared for winter.                   
OL,16,FAlmost half of the area's 168 food     
OL,17,Fbanks surveyed said the situation was  
OL,18,Fworse than in previous years, with     
OL,19,Ffalling donations, rising operating    
OL,20,Fcosts and higher demand.               
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
